---

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Attempt as Finalized Skill Assessment
  participant Outcome as RuleAssessmentOutcomeService
  participant Evidence as Official evidence and review store
  participant Pathway as RequirementPathway recalculation
  participant PG as Revision and work store
  Attempt->>Outcome: MAIN and all configured prerequisite group results
  alt Main failure or all-wrong prerequisite veto
    Outcome->>PG: Retain failed result and full-retake requirement
  else Main passes
    alt Unachieved prerequisite B fails
      Outcome->>Pathway: Add or reuse B from actual attempt and group
      Pathway->>PG: Keep passing A pending required B evidence
    else Previously achieved B fails
      Outcome->>Evidence: NEED_REVIEW without revoking prior achievement
    end
    Outcome->>Evidence: Award only when exact completion and supplements qualify
    Evidence->>Pathway: Durable accepted evidence event
    Pathway->>PG: Immutable successor, source event and valid approval basis
  end
  Note over Outcome,PG: Later A retake does not complete an already-assigned B learning step
  Note over Pathway,PG: Parallel old bypass work never gates the new target
